        <h2>What is Loggerhead.app?</h2>
        <p>Loggerhead.app is a modern web application designed to help volleyball coaches, parents, and players track comprehensive match statistics in real-time. Our platform makes it easy to log kills, assists, digs, blocks, serves, and errors with just a few taps on your mobile device.</p>

        <h2>Who Uses Loggerhead?</h2>
        <p><strong>Volleyball Coaches:</strong> Track team performance, identify strengths and weaknesses, and make data-driven decisions during matches and practice sessions.</p>
        <p><strong>Volleyball Parents:</strong> Follow your athlete's progress throughout the season with detailed statistics and professional-quality reports.</p>
        <p><strong>Volleyball Players:</strong> Monitor your own performance and work with coaches to identify areas for improvement using concrete data.</p>

        <h2>Key Features</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Live Match Tracking:</strong> Real-time stat logging with automatic rotation and substitution management</li>
            <li><strong>Team Management:</strong> Complete roster management including libero tracking and position assignments</li>
            <li><strong>Comprehensive Statistics:</strong> Track all major volleyball statistics including hitting percentages, serve efficiency, and defensive metrics</li>
            <li><strong>Professional Reports:</strong> Generate NCAA-style match reports instantly in PDF and CSV formats</li>
            <li><strong>Mobile Optimized:</strong> Designed specifically for mobile devices to make courtside stat tracking simple and accurate</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Getting Started</h2>
        <p>Ready to revolutionize how you track volleyball statistics? Getting started with Loggerhead is simple:</p>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Register:</strong> Create your free account in seconds</li>
            <li><strong>Set Up Your Team:</strong> Add players, assign jersey numbers, and configure positions</li>
            <li><strong>Start Tracking:</strong> Begin logging stats during your next match or practice</li>
            <li><strong>Review Performance:</strong> Generate detailed reports and analyze team performance</li>
        </ol>

